@startuml flow-reactivity-overview
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Vue 3 Reactivity System Overview

package "Reactive Primitives" #LightYellow {
  component "Refs" as Refs #LightYellow
  note right of Refs
    rows: Ref
    cols: Ref
    generation: Ref
    tickRate: Ref
  end note

  component "Computed" as Computed #LightYellow
  note right of Computed
    config: ComputedRef
    livingCells: ComputedRef
    isRunning: ComputedRef
    isPaused: ComputedRef
  end note

  component "Watchers" as Watchers #LightYellow
  note right of Watchers
    watch(config, ...)
    watch(board, ...)
  end note
}

package "Component Communication" #LightGreen {
  component "Props" as Props #LightGreen
  note right of Props
    Read-only
    Flow down from parent
    Reactive updates
  end note

  component "Events" as Events #LightGreen
  note right of Events
    Flow up to parent
    Non-reactive
    Trigger state changes
  end note
}

package "Core Integration" #LightCoral {
  component "Callbacks" as Callbacks #LightCoral
  note right of Callbacks
    updateState()
    onStateChange()
  end note
}

Refs --> Computed : "dependencies"
Computed --> Props : "passed to components"
Events --> Refs : "trigger updates"
Watchers --> Refs : "observe changes"
Callbacks --> Refs : "trigger reactivity"

note bottom of Refs
  **Direct Reactive Values:**
  Mutable (.value), trigger updates on change

  Example:
  const rows = ref(50)
  rows.value = 100 // triggers update
end note

note bottom of Computed
  **Derived Reactive Values:**
  Auto-recompute when dependencies change
  Cached until invalidated

  Example:
  const config = computed(() => ({
    rows: rows.value,
    cols: cols.value
  }))
end note

note bottom of Watchers
  **Side Effects:**
  Run code when values change
  Used for recreating objects

  Example:
  watch(config, (newConfig) => {
    board = new Board(newConfig)
  })
end note

note bottom of Props
  **Unidirectional Flow:**
  Parent passes data down
  Child cannot modify
  Child emits events up
end note

note bottom of Events
  **Event Flow:**
  Flow up from child to parent
  Trigger state changes in parent
end note

note bottom of Callbacks
  **Bridge to Core Logic:**
  Core has no Vue dependencies
  Callbacks trigger reactivity

  Example:
  engine.onStateChange = () => {
    updateState() // triggers refs
  }
end note

@enduml
